## Findings / notes from this rerun

- **Operator override honored:** the tier target changed mid-mission from
  gpt-5.6-luna to gpt-6-luna (tower inbox, 21:44:11Z). All repo literals,
  the live settings, and the smoke-2 spawn arg use gpt-6-luna; both the
  tower and this run probed gpt-6-luna live (routing-ok / subagent-ok).
- **The `-p` 402 regressed again after the tower's pre-mission probe:**
  the tower had verified `openai-codex/gpt-6-sol` answering `routing-ok`
  shortly before this mission; by run time (21:47–21:49Z) the `-p` path
  402'd on every attempt (personal `PRIME_API_KEY` balance, per the error
  text). Daemon-backed sessions on the same default route ran fine
  throughout (smoke-2 parent, 42 messages, zero 402s) — consistent with
  the original log's F4 and suggesting the `-p` billing path differs from
  daemon sessions. Funding the personal balance remains operator-owned.
- **F1/F2/F3 disciplines reconfirmed:** settings keys still not honored at
  spawn (child pinned via explicit `model=`, inherited parent thinking);
  headless-pty daemon-backed session required for `rlm.spawn`;
  `rlm.collect` re-polled until `done`.

